===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|workyng}}, {{m|enm|wirkynge}}, {{m|enm|worchinge}}, {{m|enm|werchinge}}, {{m|enm|workinde}}, {{m|enm|wirkand}}, {{m|enm|worchende}}, {{m|enm|wurchende}}, from {{inh|en|ang|wyrċende}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*wurkijandz}}, present participle of {{der|en|gem-pro|*wurkijaną|t=to work}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|work|ing}}. Compare {{cog|sco|wirkand}}, {{m|sco|werkand}}, {{m|sco|warkand||working}}, {{cog|nl|werkend||working, acting}}, {{cog|de|wirkend||acting, working}}.

